  m_Script: {fileID: 1455135332, guid: af56af93b18e8464f9915f7a446a8088, type: 3}
  m_Name: Enemy
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _markdownContent: "## Enemy Checklist\n\n### Collisions\n\n- Set layer to **Water**
    (used for samples so we don't add layers to the project).\n- Add an appropriate
    2D collider. \n\n### Enemy Stats\n\n- Add an EnemyStats [DataComponent](docs:components/data-component)\n-
    Set the enemy stats:\n  - Speed: Maximum movement speed.\n  - Health: Starting
    health.\n  - Orbs: Number of orbs dropped.\n  - ContactDamage: Damage inflicted
    on player.\n\n### Taking Damage\n\n- Add an FSM Template component with [TakeDamage](../../Templates/TakeDamage.asset)
    template.\n- The template will read Health and Orbs from EnemyStats.\n\n### Dealing
    Damage\n\n- Set ContactDamage in EnemyStats.\n\n### Movement\n\n- Add an FSM
    component to move the enemy.\n- Most enemies have a simple move towards hero
    behaviour that uses Speed from EnemyStats.\n"
